    <!-- The live state, carrying how far behind the source this window is playing: the live buffer the
         current media was opened with, in whole seconds. {0} is that delay. The sign, the unit and their
         order are part of the translation rather than composed in code, because a right-to-left paragraph
         reorders a bare "-{0}" unpredictably - ar and ur therefore say the delay in words. -->
    <sys:String x:Key="PlayingLive">Playing live -{0} s</sys:String>
